WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.060
Cooking odors can travel
beyond the kitchen.

00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:05.990
Carried by exhaust, they can
reach neighboring businesses

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
and nearby outdoor spaces.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:13.090
Molitron's Odor Abatement
System introduces a fine mist

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:16.340
of Odor Neutralizer Solution
into the exhaust duct.

00:00:16.580 --> 00:00:18.520
Treatment happens before discharge,

00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:21.060
helping control odors
carried by the airflow.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:24.770
The system pairs a wall-mounted cabinet

00:00:24.780 --> 00:00:27.100
with a ten-gallon solution container.

00:00:27.180 --> 00:00:29.070
Choose a convenient indoor location

00:00:29.080 --> 00:00:31.260
where kitchen staff
can check the system,

00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:33.160
hear the low-solution alarm,

00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:35.840
and easily reach the
container for replenishment.

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:41.730
After startup, separate
lines carry compressed air

00:00:41.740 --> 00:00:44.350
and solution mixed with
water to the nozzles.

00:00:44.360 --> 00:00:45.860
During scheduled operation,

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:48.920
they form a fine mist that
moves with the exhaust.

00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:54.800
Your site team plans building power,

00:00:54.980 --> 00:00:57.340
cold water, an accessible shutoff,

00:00:57.420 --> 00:00:59.500
and a separate fan-control connection.

00:01:00.340 --> 00:01:04.200
Confirm installation and startup
responsibilities with Molitron,

00:01:04.360 --> 00:01:07.700
along with mounting, tubing
routes, and service access.

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:13.260
The fan interlock prevents treatment
when the exhaust fan is off.

00:01:13.460 --> 00:01:15.500
The controller sets treatment periods.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:20.180
Ongoing care includes solution
checks, replenishment, and service.

00:01:20.540 --> 00:01:22.300
Respond to low-solution alerts.

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:28.020
Founded in 1986, Molitron
fabricates equipment in Colorado.

00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:30.250
You can speak directly
with the manufacturer

00:01:30.260 --> 00:01:34.280
about your application, installation
planning, and ongoing care.

00:01:35.500 --> 00:01:38.050
Let's review your
odor-control application,

00:01:38.060 --> 00:01:40.400
whether it's a restaurant
or another business.

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:44.820
Share your location, odor source,
and any exhaust details you have.

00:01:44.920 --> 00:01:47.620
Email clean air at Molitron dot com.
